  <section class="cv-sec"><div class="cv-wrap">
  <div class="section-head cv-shead"><div class="section-kick cv-kick">ISSUES</div><h2 class="section-h2 cv-h2">我關心的議題</h2></div>
  <div class="cv-chips"><span class="cv-chip off">勞動與在地經濟</span><span class="cv-chip off">健康與社會福利</span><a class="cv-chip" href="/issues/expose/"><svg class="cv-cic" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M192,64V77.33a8,8,0,0,1-1.6,4.8l-20.8,27.74a8,8,0,0,0-1.6,4.8V224a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H96a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V114.67a8,8,0,0,0-1.6-4.8L65.6,82.13a8,8,0,0,1-1.6-4.8V64Z" opacity="0.2"/><path d="M184,16H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,32V77.33a16.12,16.12,0,0,0,3.2,9.6L80,114.67V224a16,16,0,0,0,16,16h64a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V114.67l20.8-27.74a16.12,16.12,0,0,0,3.2-9.6V32A16,16,0,0,0,184,16ZM72,32H184V56H72V32Zm91.2,73.07a16.12,16.12,0,0,0-3.2,9.6V224H96V114.67a16.12,16.12,0,0,0-3.2-9.6L72,77.33V72H184v5.33ZM136,120v32a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V120a8,8,0,0,1,16,0Z"/></svg>廉政監督與揭露真相</a><span class="cv-chip off">文化與地方認同</span><span class="cv-chip off">居住與土地正義</span></div>
</div></section>
  
  <section class="cv-sec cv-fellowsec"><div class="cv-wrap">
  <div class="section-head cv-shead"><div class="section-kick cv-kick">TEAM</div><h2 class="section-h2 cv-h2">看看台灣前進<span class="u">高雄市的夥伴</span></h2></div>
  <div class="cv-fellows"><a class="cv-fcard" href="/yu-hsien-ling"><span class="cv-fava"><img src="/assets/faces/head/yu-hsien-ling.webp" alt="于仙玲" loading="lazy"></span><div><div class="cv-fn">于仙玲</div><div class="cv-fm"><span class="cv-pdot" style="background:var(--obs)"></span>小歐盟 前鎮、小港</div></div></a></div>
